==Official Introduction==
> Lynae, a Preparatory Program student at Startorch Academy, is a free spirit with passion in her soul.
She drives fast and "paints" boldly. Her dearest wish is for her trouble-free campus life to last forever.
> — Description from the [https://wutheringwaves.kurogames.com/m/en/main/#resonators Official Website] 

==Personality==
Lynae was a mercenary born in the lawless zone, hired by the New Federation government, one of whose missions was to kill the real "Lynae." Like other mercenaries, she was cold and ruthless, believing that anything that wasn't a weapon or equipment was "dead weight." During her mission, she found an acceptance letter from Startorch Academy and took it, faking her death and assuming the identity of "Lynae." Once isolated, now carefree and vibrant, Lynae developed an affection for Startorch Academy and wished to remain a student, alongside her friends. Some old habits, however, still reminded her of who she once was.

==Appearance==
Lynae is a young woman of average height with fair skin and sharp purple-blue eyes. Her hair is dyed a light blonde with teal highlights mixed in and her original hair color peaks through via her dark brown roots. She keeps her hair primarily down with the exception of a small chunk of hair tied into a hoop aswell as various braids across her head, bangs, and the back of her head.

Her [[Tacet Mark]] is located on the posterior side of her left thigh.

===Clothing===
Lynae wears a white dress shirt tucked into her skirt and a loose teal and green tie with a black cat tie clip attached. She keeps her sleeves rolled up, and her shirt features spray paint stains. Across her chest and around her shoulder and waist is a black strap; a white and iridescent jacket hangs from the back. She keeps her student ID card clipped onto the strap around her waist. Her skirt is black, pleated, high-waisted, and ends partway down her thighs. Additionally, Lynae has a black garter on her right thigh, with a spray can attached to it. She sports calf-reaching black socks with black boots with teal soles that that have rollerblade wheels situated on the back. Black and white headphones sit around her neck, and painted nails, rings, and bracelets decorate her hands.

